{"agent_id":"79Ig","agent_seq":260,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:39:43.840686Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"2881253a-3641-4d7b-a6c1-e09cbbd2d140","comment_uuid":"e9778298-353c-44d4-b144-1be697bf0a4b","author":"79Ig","content":"OPERATOR DIRECTIVE (2026-07-28, standing until vsdd-cli reaches alpha): adopt vsdd methodology for mdatron's own development — the discipline, not the tool. Two halves, both required.\n\nCONDUCT (adopt as behavior):\n1. Phase discipline: design(1a, internal spec-review loop) -> verification-architecture(1b) -> decomposition(1c) -> red-gate(2a) -> implement-to-green(2b) -> exit-gate(2c) -> adversarial cold review(3) -> route findings(4) -> harden(5) -> exit(6). Phases are crosslink milestones; exits are boundary commits + typed result comments.\n2. Route findings BEFORE fixing (#1 lesson): every review finding routes to the phase that would have prevented it before any fix; a fix-close with no prior routing plan is malformed; never grind fix-in-place.\n3. Owned/reviewed spec changes: never hand-edit governing DESIGN solo; a spec change re-enters 1a under a declared composition + cold multi-lens review; operator ratification is the EXIT, not a substitute for the process.\n4. Crosslink discipline: issue-before-code; typed comments; findings carry owner+validator; closures carry evidence or a disposition.\n5. Naming/register: no coined labels, letter-clusters, or all-caps tokens; plain names; a durable term is a registration act.\n\nENFORCEMENT (mechanize — 'bind, don't just document'; conduct alone drifts). Three named binds + the escape corpus as regression seeds:\n- mdatron rule: a round-result comment missing its child-issue handle citations is flagged (parity).\n- git pre-commit: a governed-DESIGN change whose commit evidence doesn't cite the ratified review is refused (amendment discipline).\n- a check that a fix-close finding carries a prior routing plan.\nSeams live across: mdatron patterns over the design+review-log estate; git pre-commit; a session-stop hook (the .claude/hooks estate); crosslink-querying scripts for the tracker estate.\n\nHONEST BOUNDARY: phase-answer derivation, process-integrity status queries, and mechanized gate commands need vsdd-cli (not shippable yet) — keep those as conduct + cold review; don't wait on the tool for the rest.\n\nREGRESSION SEEDS (escape corpus — the seams must catch each, or they're insufficient): (a) detection-without-a-seam is advisory only; (b) fix-in-place; (c) relabel a fix-close as a disposition to dodge routing; (d) fix with no owning finding filed; (e) forge a self-authored gate/composition record; (f) edit the checker itself.\n\nDECOMPOSITION (child lanes to file): (i) conduct governing doc + cold review + operator ratification; (ii) pre-commit amendment-discipline seam + seed; (iii) routing-plan-before-fix-close seam + seed; (iv) round-result/child-issue parity seam + seed; (v) session-stop hook binding the disciplines + edit-the-checker seed; (vi) mdatron dogfood patterns over review-log/DESIGN estate. This adoption is itself run under the discipline: this issue is the milestone, this comment its 1a plan.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:39:43.827249Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:u0VtJEsnHrvNPG5QQKKfDO+Rro/KT/xZqEvahzZTqEA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOk7MLoVvSEPAWM9VkHKFnHq8O1iEkPSfqY7zLc4I28oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA9mN+D3zfcvUm4igsx5a57o2dqg3Jy/fk9tB0ssI0zzKdollDD4l+ZknzDSHtHi96sgcCInmutj8g+KVPX2bPCw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:u0VtJEsnHrvNPG5QQKKfDO+Rro/KT/xZqEvahzZTqEA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOk7MLoVvSEPAWM9VkHKFnHq8O1iEkPSfqY7zLc4I28oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQA1L+qdMxiXM805I2OjQpituAyqqqnyIdwdGBXtnndmcZkSgS77l3nMgEkn3B1Sq/GEOmZLpuvfjdrtCYLZ1ngY="}
