{"agent_id":"79Ig","agent_seq":310,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T05:28:07.330327Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"f00730f0-5883-4ad4-9ae0-9a665b2baa0b","comment_uuid":"4458d90d-d90c-4900-93ba-cd03bcca7d2a","author":"79Ig","content":"Landed the methodology-enforcement arc (#96 conduct + amendment-citation friction guardrail; #97 governed-estate register / vocabulary_globs CI-backed; #99 dropped the leaky session-stop hook and adopted vsdd's enforcement-grades model per #819). Merged v0.3.0 polish #98 (W0043 zero-match loudness) + #95 (W0044 registered-and-draft). Also merged #93 (DSL filter). Ratified the #92 incremental-verify decomposition (5 sub-lanes A-E); designed sub-lane B (#100, dependency resolver) and cut its branch — implementation deferred to a fresh session (key blocker: index lacks file provenance). Deferred routing-before-fix-close + round-result parity as conduct-only (honest boundary). main green + pushed. 0.3.0 cuttable; #48 publish held.","created_at":"2026-07-29T05:28:07.316270Z","kind":"handoff","signed_by":"SHA256:u0VtJEsnHrvNPG5QQKKfDO+Rro/KT/xZqEvahzZTqEA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOk7MLoVvSEPAWM9VkHKFnHq8O1iEkPSfqY7zLc4I28oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA10gPVjQr3nYFHUsMC/xTunw0oKftxAMVejt9Edxvy53SXQU1zlp3zHHsdlhd3DC6GDgmB1iuCFXcfgSKNT9gAw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:u0VtJEsnHrvNPG5QQKKfDO+Rro/KT/xZqEvahzZTqEA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOk7MLoVvSEPAWM9VkHKFnHq8O1iEkPSfqY7zLc4I28oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMh+vOhi7ddBWcktOJRuqHEj95rUXsXzWady2A5vxpV3zcqSLzAXhNkSH3nyBpCCUXloHaI1BKb+STs63h230QQ="}
