{"agent_id":"79Ig","agent_seq":313,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T05:58:35.463467Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"f00730f0-5883-4ad4-9ae0-9a665b2baa0b","comment_uuid":"36534afc-9930-4f94-95b6-b344dc3867f0","author":"79Ig","content":"EXIT — sub-lane B complete on feature/100-dependency-resolver (6abd189). DepGraph resolves the transitive dependent set over all three DESIGN edge kinds; B1 provenance-aware index (entries semantics preserved), B2 key()-extraction via Expr walk, B3 BFS closure, B4 the four hand-authored edge-kind fixtures + real-file provenance. Phase-3 cold review found 3 missing-edge (unsoundness) classes — F1 message-key(), F2 dynamic index name, F3 governed_by normalization — all fixed in-lane with F4 coverage (12 dep tests). Gauntlet green, self-verify + pin clean. AWAITING merge gate. Sub-lane C (incremental mode + soundness oracle) is next in #92 and will validate incremental==whole-tree over this resolver.","created_at":"2026-07-29T05:58:35.446812Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:u0VtJEsnHrvNPG5QQKKfDO+Rro/KT/xZqEvahzZTqEA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOk7MLoVvSEPAWM9VkHKFnHq8O1iEkPSfqY7zLc4I28oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAGEh7VcUvD1PMo1OqOPxen6Y28mmjrLFHLVC0RrtomjrZbAPYIoXfvF1i0WDxDBIiKdDD63Fd8eOIDkF+h9f4Bg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:u0VtJEsnHrvNPG5QQKKfDO+Rro/KT/xZqEvahzZTqEA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOk7MLoVvSEPAWM9VkHKFnHq8O1iEkPSfqY7zLc4I28oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHGxk4Oh+mYx726UKOemgb9gGs3o9VcKHhAybvyFU/5lc7ZV4hD3AQITv+EWg7IogBXibeDZy2GuqKB530il/wc="}
